    verification srRelRecordedReleaseV1 : Test { :>> id = "08a3953a-ac7a-46b0-96f6-4b1e62bd7577"; :>> title = "Each release is an authored Release item; contents computed from its commit"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-21"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Releases are authored facts: .tracking/baselines.sysml carries a Release item per shipped version (release020-023 inspected: commit SHA + purpose + the version in the title), and the baseline is computed as-of that commit rather than hand-written. READ AGAINST THE AMENDED SCHEMA: the SR's letter names a membershipRule field, which accepted D0142 removed as dead schema (it lived on the never-instantiated part def Release; the live occurrence def carries commit + purpose) - the membership rule IS the commit under D0036/D0042's design, where contents are a query over the tree at that SHA. Residual stated plainly: the version lives in the title string, not a typed field."; }
