    #Verify dependency from srRelRecordedReleaseV1 to srRelRecordedRelease;

    verification srRelSemverReconciledV1 : Test { :>> id = "681aabd8-3c1a-4e73-a84a-b147cb25390d"; :>> title = "Three versions, no reconciliation"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-21"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "HONEST FAIL. Probed: the crate/binary reports 0.2.3, the API/write contract reports 2.0.0 (KEEL_API_VERSION, bumped this week for the required-judged-by break), and the claude-surface generator carries its own SURFACE_VERSION - three independently-moving version identities with no single declared semver reconciling them and no toolchain check against a declared value (the parity gap is srDcEngineVersionParityV1's same finding from the release side). This result flips when one declared version binds them or a recorded Decision states why they intentionally diverge."; }
